# Production build settings. Vite loads this automatically for `npm run build`.
#
# The base URL is deliberately empty. In production the dashboard is served by Caddy
# from the same origin that proxies /api to the backend container, so relative requests
# reach the API without CORS and without baking a hostname into the bundle. Setting an
# absolute URL here would make every request cross-origin and reintroduce the CORS
# dependency the same-origin deployment exists to remove.
VITE_API_URL=
